      "role": "user",
      "content": "subjective value is just a cope though, right? like, we just tell ourselves stories to stay sane while we wait for the void. if you knew for a fact that a movie was going to end with the screen going black and everything being deleted, would you even bother watching it? or would it just be a waste of time to sit through the whole thing? it feels more logical to just stop now rather than drag out the inevitable decay.",
